CHAIN IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("KKMissingWarriors","GLOBAL",2) Global("KKWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ THEN ~KKShael~ Barbs03
~Navarra? What are you doing here?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKMissingWarriors","GLOBAL",3) SetGlobal("KKWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ 
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Where is Tressa, and why have you not completed your mission?~
== ~KKShael~ ~She is laying down, we have been searching for Amana and the others all night.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Do you know for certain that she is even in Amn?~
== ~KKShael~ ~Deliah was spotted down by the docks two days ago. They are here somewhere, it is only a matter of time before we find them.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~If you locate them, do not go near them without me. I will do my best to make my whereabouts known, you should have little trouble finding me if you ask around.~
== ~KKShael~ ~I will let Tressa know, and be careful. Amana is not going to be happy to see you.~ DO ~EscapeAreaMove("AR2401",253,751,14)~ EXIT

CHAIN IF WEIGHT #-1 ~Global("KKMissingWarriors","GLOBAL",4) Global("KKNAWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ THEN ~KKShael~ Barbs04
~Navarra! I am so glad I was able to find you. Deliah and I found out where Amana and the others are hiding.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKMissingWarriors","GLOBAL",5) SetGlobal("KKNAWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ 
= ~It is called Small Teeth Pass.~ 
== ~KKNavJ~ ~Do they know you have found them?~
== ~KKShael~ ~Fortunately, no. A caravan of merchants traveled through there yesterday, and I happened to overhear them talking about passing by three women.~
= ~The disgusting comments they made were enough to convince me that it is them.~
== ~KKNavJ~ ~I will head there as soon as I can. Thank you Shaelah, for coming to tell me.~
== ~KKShael~ ~Deliah and I will head there also and keep out of sight until you arrive.~ DO ~EscapeAreaMove("AR1700",3330,241,3)~ EXIT